from h34 import *
M=mcq;F=tf;S=short;N=num
b='<rect x="20" y="20" width="220" height="120" rx="10" fill="#f4f1e8" stroke="#333"/><text x="130" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">on</text><rect x="90" y="48" width="80" height="14" fill="#a56b3a"/><circle cx="130" cy="40" r="0"/><circle cx="130" cy="75" r="14" fill="#e4572e"/><text x="130" y="112" text-anchor="middle">The ball is on the table.</text><rect x="80" y="120" width="100" height="10" fill="#a56b3a"/>'
b2='<rect x="260" y="20" width="220" height="120" rx="10" fill="#f4f1e8" stroke="#333"/><text x="370" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">in</text><rect x="320" y="60" width="100" height="50" fill="#d9b26f" stroke="#333"/><circle cx="370" cy="80" r="12" fill="#2e86ab"/><text x="370" y="130" text-anchor="middle">The ball is in the box.</text>'
b3='<rect x="500" y="20" width="220" height="120" rx="10" fill="#f4f1e8" stroke="#333"/><text x="610" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">under</text><rect x="550" y="55" width="120" height="14" fill="#a56b3a"/><rect x="556" y="69" width="8" height="45" fill="#a56b3a"/><rect x="656" y="69" width="8" height="45" fill="#a56b3a"/><circle cx="610" cy="100" r="12" fill="#3a9d5d"/><text x="610" y="132" text-anchor="middle">The ball is under the table.</text>'
